
### `.gitignore`

For this project, use:

```gitignore
# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environments
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/

# IDE / Editor files
.vscode/
.idea/

# Python tooling
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

# Environment variables / secrets
.env
.env.*

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

# Generated reports
inventory.txt
inventory.csv
network.log